              "type": "code",
              "language": "pseudocode",
              "text": "value1 <- RANDOM(min, max)\n\nREPEAT\n    value2 <- RANDOM(min, max)\nUNTIL value2 <> value1\n\nIF condition THEN\n    value3 <- RANDOM(otherMin, otherMax)\nENDIF"
